Maven (<code>pom.xml</code>)Gradle (<code>build.gradle</code>)Checkstyle CLI <p>Add <code>checkstyle-spellcheck</code> as a dependency inside your <code>maven-checkstyle-plugin</code>:</p> <pre><code>&lt;plugin&gt;
  &lt;groupId&gt;org.apache.maven.plugins&lt;/groupId&gt;
  &lt;artifactId&gt;maven-checkstyle-plugin&lt;/artifactId&gt;
  &lt;version&gt;3.6.0&lt;/version&gt;
  &lt;dependencies&gt;
    &lt;dependency&gt;
      &lt;groupId&gt;io.github.praveen7294&lt;/groupId&gt;
      &lt;artifactId&gt;checkstyle-spellcheck&lt;/artifactId&gt;
      &lt;version&gt;0.1.0&lt;/version&gt;
    &lt;/dependency&gt;
  &lt;/dependencies&gt;
  &lt;configuration&gt;
    &lt;configLocation&gt;config/checkstyle.xml&lt;/configLocation&gt;
  &lt;/configuration&gt;
&lt;/plugin&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Add the extension to your <code>checkstyle</code> configuration:</p> <pre><code>plugins {
    id 'checkstyle'
}

dependencies {
    checkstyle 'io.github.praveen7294:checkstyle-spellcheck:0.1.0'
}
</code></pre> <p>Include the extension JAR alongside the Checkstyle all-in-one JAR on the Java classpath:</p> <pre><code>java -cp "checkstyle-14.4.0-all.jar;checkstyle-spellcheck-0.1.0.jar" \
  com.puppycrawl.tools.checkstyle.Main -c checkstyle.xml src/
</code></pre>
